  "note": "Almost the whole song sits on E7: lock into a steady eighth-note groove and keep it rolling. The only change is a quick D then A stab on the last two beats of a phrase, back on E7 for the next downbeat. The tremolo guitar figure of the intro and the solos are left out; their backing is the same E7.",
