  "remarks": "Album version (5:16). Three charts agree: E7 throughout with D to A stabs at phrase ends, and on the order of sections. None gives bar lines, so the bar counts and where the stabs fall (beats 3 and 4, every fourth bar in verses, every second in choruses) are my estimate, fitted to tempo and length. The outro fades.",
